WEB APPLICATIONS :

Servlets :
          it is a Java class
          handles request and response
          - Two Types of Servlets :
                                1. Generic Servlets
                                    Manages all types of protocols -
                                            Ex: HTTP, FTP, SMTP . (here http is most commonly used, that's why we prefer Http Servlets)

                                2. Http Servlets
                                    Specifically for Http

(Server is a container of Servlets) As Servlets run on server and Servlets result is seen on browser.

(client -- sends --> request -- to --> server -- request handled by -- > servlets -- goes to backend for operations
--> response -- sent back to server by --> servlet -- reaches to -- > client)

