Lifecycle of Servlets :
        3 Stages -
            1. Init
                    - Servlet gets 'initialises' only when it is called. Ex: /hello

            2. Service
                    - This is execution stage.
                    - i.e. execution happens in these methods - doGet, doPut, doPost, doDelete, doPatch

            3. Destroy
                    - When we shutdown the server, all servlets will get destroyed.

